/-!
# A positive Euler characteristic coefficient on an abelian scheme

For an abelian scheme over an algebraically closed field, this file constructs an invertible sheaf
whose tensor powers have polynomial Euler characteristic. The coefficient in the relative
dimension is positive.
-/

